{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Screening log"},"description":"Turn the screening decisions of a systematic review into its PRISMA 2020 counts, flow diagram and screening log. Give one row per record: its title/abstract decision (include or exclude), its full-text decision for records that passed (include, exclude or not_retrieved), and the reason for each exclusion. Every box from \"records screened\" down is counted from the rows, so the diagram always matches the decisions; full-text exclusions are grouped by reason. Returns the diagram (PNG, SVG, links), the counts, a CSV of every decision for the review appendix, and the problems a reviewer would catch: full-text exclusions without a reason, records still waiting for a full-text decision, and duplicate ids. Add the identification counts (records from databases, duplicates removed) to complete the top of the diagram. At most 5000 records per call.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"footnotes":{"default":true,"description":"Print the template footnotes and source attribution.","type":"boolean"},"identification":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Counts before screening, for the top of the diagram.","properties":{"automationIneligible":{"$ref":"#/properties/identification/properties/databases"},"databaseSources":{"description":"Per-database counts, e.g. [{\"name\":\"MEDLINE\",\"n\":812}].","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"n":{"$ref":"#/properties/identification/properties/databases"},"name":{"maxLength":160,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["name","n"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":30,"type":"array"},"databases":{"description":"Records identified from databases (total).","maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"duplicatesRemoved":{"$ref":"#/properties/identification/proper